{"Title":"An Act relative to acceptance of certain types of identification to purchase alcohol in Massachusetts","BillNumber":"H4131","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J17","Name":"Joint Committee on Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17","ResponseDate":"2023-10-12T14:02:36.34"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"P_M1","Name":"Paul McMurtry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/P_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T14:17:19.5866667"},{"Id":"PDJ0","Name":"Patricia D. Jehlen","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:09:09.1233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4131/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 34B of Chapter 138 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words \"foreign country,\" in line 19, the following new text:-  a valid license to operate a motor vehicle issued by another state, or a Global Entry card issued by the United States Customs and Border Protection office,\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 34B of said chapter 138, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by striking out, in lines 25 through 27, inclusive, the words “a liquor purchase identification card, or an identification card issued under section 8E of chapter 90, or motor vehicle license issued pursuant to said section eight”, and inserting in place thereof the following:- identification permitted by this section\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}